  Candid | Candid shot, natural lighting, motion blur, authentic moment, lifestyle
  Chalkboard | Chalkboard art, white chalk on black, dusty texture, hand drawn, rough
  Charcoal | Charcoal sketch, rough lines, smudge effects, artistic contrast, grey
  Cinematic | Cinematic lighting, dramatic shadows, shot on 35mm film, grainy texture
  Claymation | stop motion style, plasticine texture, aardman style, soft lighting, playful
  Concept Art | Digital concept art, Unreal Engine 5 render, ray tracing, Octane render
  Cubist | Cubist style, fragmented shapes, multiple perspectives, abstract, Picasso
  Cyberpunk | neon holograms, high-tech low-life, chrome details, futuristic city, blue and pink lighting
  Digital Painting | concept art style, artstation trending, clean lines, digital brushwork, dynamic lighting
  Double Exposure | Double exposure, superimposed images, silhouette, artistic blend, nature
  Fantasy Art | Fantasy art, magical atmosphere, epic scale, detailed background, mystical
