  Golden Hour | Golden hour lighting, warm sun flare, backlit, sunset colors, outdoor
  GoPro | GoPro footage style, wide angle lens, fisheye distortion, action shot, raw
  Gothic | dark atmosphere, cathedral architecture, stained glass, ornate details, moody lighting, vampiresque
  Graffiti | graffiti style, spray paint texture, banksy style, stencils, urban decay background, bold messages
  Grunge | Grunge aesthetic, dirty texture, distressed, scratchy, dark, edgy
  Impressionism | visible brush strokes, monet style, focus on light and movement, pastel colors, soft focus
  Ink Style | Ink illustration, comic book style, bold linework, dynamic shading, graphic
  Low Poly | geometric shapes, flat shading, 3d model, minimalist, sharp edges, video game asset
  Macro | Macro photography, extreme close-up, shallow depth of field, bokeh, details
  Minimalist | Minimalist style, negative space, simple lines, neutral colors, zen
  Nat Geo | National Geographic style, documentary, raw, detailed, authentic, travel
  Oil Painting | thick impasto brushstrokes, textured canvas, classical composition, rich pigments, masterpiece
  Paper Cutout | Paper cutout art, layered depth, shadows, craft aesthetic, collage
  Pencil Sketch | graphite texture, cross-hatching, rough lines, charcoal shading, sketchbook aesthetic
  Photorealistic | 8k resolution, raw photo, f/1.8 aperture, highly detailed skin texture, ray tracing, unreal engine 5
  Pixel Art | 16-bit graphics, retro gaming style, dithering, blocky details, vibrant palette
  Pixar 3D | Pixar style 3D, smooth shapes, bright colors, expressive, animation
  Polaroid | Polaroid photo, vintage aesthetics, flash photography, faded look, instant
  Pop Art | andy warhol style, halftone dots, bold primary colors, comic book aesthetic, repetition
  Renaissance | da vinci style, sfumato, anatomical precision, classical poses, golden ratio, marble textures
  Retro | Retro 80s style, neon colors, grid lines, synthwave aesthetic, nostalgic
  Rococo | pastel colors, ornate gold, asymmetry, playful, fragonard style, soft light, romantic
  Romanticism | Romanticism style, emotional, dramatic nature, sublime landscape, oil
  Sci-Fi Concept | Sci-fi concept art, sleek metal, high tech, futuristic environment, clean
  Soft Focus | Soft focus, dreamy atmosphere, pastel colors, ethereal glow, romantic
  Stained Glass | Stained glass effect, vibrant light, lead lines, mosaic pattern, colorful
  Steampunk | brass gears, victorian aesthetic, steam powered, copper pipes, leather accessories, sepia tones
  Street Art | graffiti style, spray paint texture, street art, urban vibe, mural
  Studio Photo | Studio photography, professional lighting, softbox, neutral background, clean
  Surrealism | dreamlike atmosphere, salvador dali style, melting objects, defying gravity, bizarre juxtapositions
  Synthwave | retro 80s aesthetic, grid lines, sunset gradients, laser lights, outrun style, digital art
  Thermal | Thermal camera effect, heat map colors, infrared spectrum, technical
  Ukiyo-e | japanese woodblock print, flat perspective, bold outlines, traditional patterns, hokusai style
  Ultra HD 8k | Ultra HD 8k photorealistic, highly detailed, sharp focus, Canon EOS R5
  Vaporwave | 90s internet aesthetic, greek statues, glitch art, pastel gradients, windows 95 UI elements
  Vector Art | Vector art, flat design, clean curves, Adobe Illustrator style, modern
  Vintage Comic | 1950s style, ben-day dots, speech bubbles, bold ink lines, yellowed paper texture
  Vintage Poster | Vintage 1950s poster style, grainy texture, saturated colors, retro
